    "text": "Let the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> respectively. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to",
